        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi guddaani, Waaqi Israeli, waan jed'u, Anini Amoni, waaqa Thebesitifi Misirifi waaqoota isiitiifi hayyoota isiile ch'ufa ingaargalcha. Anini hayyu Misiritiifi nama isa abdatu ch'ufa fuud'e, ",
